PARITY MODEL: closest web sibling is AISignalExplorerNlFilter (0046) — the useAiStream +
typed-tool_result-capture + onApply(children) pattern. Three faithful deltas, all dictated by THIS
web source:
  (a) NO vehicle/prompt inputs — body is `{}`; `canStart = state !== 'paused-confirm'` (no hasVehicle/
      hasPrompt predicate); the friendly empty state is the resting "nothing proposed yet" hint.
  (b) the capture guard DOES inspect `ev.ok` (`&& ev.ok`), the proposal fields live at the TOP level of
      `data` (not nested under `data.draft`), and `bypass_severities` is FILTERED to strings (web
      `.filter`, NOT rejected) — reproduced verbatim in `QuietHoursDraftProposal.from(_:)`.
  (c) the unmount clears the proposal (web `setProposal(null)`), so `QuietHoursSuggestionModel.stop()`
      nils `proposal` — distinguishing it from the signal-explorer sibling whose stop keeps the draft.

